        <tei:head xml:lang="en">Purim Service</tei:head>
        <tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">Everyone is obligated to hear the reading of the Megillah on the night of Purim and again on the day of Purim itself. The following three blessings are recited by the Reader.</tei:note>
